olor:#121212;">
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">The Champions League is off and plodding t=
hrough its embiggened league phase, with 36 teams playing the first of eigh=
t lucrative midweek fixtures. Real Madrid <a href=3D"https://ablink.editori=
al.theguardian.com/ss/c/u001.Yw_JkLMEmFuifc_XG18IRyTNtZQ7fIEMgszcCSneHEBgtj=
