E" style=3D"color: #0077B6;">withstood a late threat</a> from Inter, Man Ci=
ty <a href=3D"https://ablink.editorial.theguardian.com/ss/c/u001.Yw_JkLMEmF=
uifc_XG18IRyTNtZQ7fIEMgszcCSneHEBgtjhYSJYcaNsDra0BxnPgmaJqUUVZIIIKpSIJjq3LA=
