a_QwYdB7Vpn7kCeoO_zskKq0-S4ar7cOQztA9l3sQ4Cyfg_g7DTziHV8Kbb7LKSIdDtrauI_Zoi=
fLqva4CNzZo_uK-LSuHqGczDKQNK3m2w/4tx/ujI1VfiVTA2Oipjl0tuN-A/h16/h001.l-mgAq=
qwWMS3-a4p1hhbfqfBUT__GWLv-J4XgwzqD_E" style=3D"color: #0077B6;">won their =
first continental clash</a> post-Pep, and the showmen of Barcelona opened t=
heir campaign with panache in a 5-1 thumping of Feyenoord.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Lamine Yamal was especially lively in <a h=
ref=3D"https://ablink.editorial.theguardian.com/ss/c/u001.Yw_JkLMEmFuifc_XG=
18IRyTNtZQ7fIEMgszcCSneHED_M98oT0Yx4o-mNe2vcLpTToxiOR-AlM0vhqPvVE_58FZJbAs7=
