1DJyvSinE3iMF1-ceW4esinJParg9KeYgToQWR7ezb1OxtKEEP3HgbIUBOAzV8bIXyv-y25FUuq=
cpTV7UsShcRocvi_AVBZMHJ-5Q9FUTAlR_l4KEk3O-bTmmv0qsLPXTlqeCF5vhMuwFznYuX1IbT=
1CM/4tx/ujI1VfiVTA2Oipjl0tuN-A/h17/h001.zP-cT_vBEt_16xxqnu-D5uW_6lFWxXP0bpk=
AmCOS9WA" style=3D"color: #0077B6;">Wednesday=E2=80=99s win</a>, an encoura=
ging sight after his injury-riddled World Cup. He left grownups giggling th=
roughout Camp Nou as he found a seam in the defensive wall to bury a 21-yar=
d free kick, in between assists on the opening and final goal.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">As always seems to be the case for Barcelo=
na, Hansi Flick=E2=80=99s side are a popular pick to win this year=E2=80=99=
s Champions League. Those hopes seem better founded as this bumper crop of =
La Masia prospects can now operate with the assurance that comes from Rodri=
=E2=80=99s masterful sweeping and shepherding in midfield. Then again, even=
 Feyenoord managed to find their own opportunities to exploit the Bar=C3=A7=
a defense, capitalizing on their upfield wanderlust with incisive counters.=
</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Better teams will be even more effective a=
t exploiting their weaknesses, but that=E2=80=99s a problem Flick will face=
 another day. For now, the reigning champions of Spain are atop the early s=
tandings with aims to win a first continental title since 2015.</p>
